arithmetic (blind, blind-sign, finalize, verify, key generate, key import, key recover, SPKI export, public-key id), because the `Option<opaque>` fields can never hold key state and FFI is forbidden.\n\nBuild verified with `cargo build` (using `OPENSSL_NO_VENDOR=1` against the system OpenSSL on the build host); no errors, only naming-style warnings on identifiers the rules forbid me from renaming."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":307,"cache_read_input_tokens":65124,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":307,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59f368fc-e573-40db-bf66-efb703559b93","uuid":"64e9b306-0738-45ac-a00c-f88e367bdb67"}
